        <mxCell id="accept-rules" value="Minimum-Price Protection&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Bid amount must be at least the confirmed minimum; the bidder must not be the holder.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Confirmation sets a minimum price, not a fixed bidder. If a higher bid replaces it, execution may accept that higher bid.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Settlement uses the ETH already held in bid escrow. No extra payment transaction is needed from the buyer." style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontColor=#162b42;strokeWidth=1.6;shape=note;size=18;backgroundOutline=1;fillColor=#f6f8fb;strokeColor=#c5d1df;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=20;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=17;" vertex="1" parent="1">
